Tier thresholds mapping risk score to the maximum allowed tier. Lower-risk requests may receive a higher tier; higher-risk requests are clipped down.
  - T3_FULL_ACCESS: {'max_risk': 0.2}
  - T2_MONITORED_ACCESS: {'max_risk': 0.5}
  - T1_RESTRICTED_ACCESS: {'max_risk': 0.8}
  - T0_REJECT: {'min_risk': 0.8}
